OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after collision
OL,4,Awith car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian has died after a collision
OL,7,Fwith a car in Amersham.
OL,9,FThames Valley Police was called to the
OL,10,Fincident on Whielden Lane in the
OL,11,FBuckinghamshire town at about 23:15 BST
OL,12,Fon Saturday.
OL,14,FThe pedestrian, a man in his 40s, died
OL,15,Fat the scene.
OL,17,FThames Valley Police said the driver of
OL,18,Fa grey Toyota Corolla involved in the
OL,19,Fcrash was not injured and no arrests
OL,20,Fhave been made.
